# Vercel upload exclusions for the frontend deployment.
# The deployment serves the CRA frontend (root vercel.json builds frontend/
# and serves frontend/build). The Express/SQLite backend does not run on
# Vercel — but backend/ must NOT be excluded here: two frontend files
# type-import from backend/ (EnterpriseAdminPortal imports
# backend/analytics/DocumentAnalytics and backend/security/EnterpriseSecurity),
# and the production build's type check fails without them. Verified the
# hard way 2026-10-25: a frontend-only tree fails with TS2307.
bofa_security_generator.py
bofa_security_master.py
bofa_security_uv_pro.py
*.png
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml
docker-compose.ultra.yml
install.sh
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/build/
node_modules/
.git/
